<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
	  <IsPackable>true</IsPackable>
	  <TargetFrameworks>net10.0;net11.0</TargetFrameworks>
    <Configurations>Debug;Release;NuGet</Configurations>
    <Version>11.0.0</Version>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>true</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
	  <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/CAUCA-9-1-1/cause-security-management</RepositoryUrl>
	  <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/CAUCA-9-1-1/cause-security-management</PackageProjectUrl>
    <AssemblyVersion>11.0.0</AssemblyVersion>
    <FileVersion>11.0.0</FileVersion>
    <Authors>Fred Catellier-Poulin, Michael Jolin, Claudine Gagnon</Authors>
    <Description>Base models for the Cause.SecurityManagement's library.</Description>
    <Copyright>CAUCA 9-1-1 (c) 2025</Copyright>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
11.0.0 - Adds .NET 11 support. The packages now target both net10.0 and net11.0. There is no API
or behavior change in this release: it carries the same code as 10.10.0.

Upgrading from before 10.10.0: read the 10.10.0 release notes first. Their ACTION REQUIRED item about
AuthenticateResult.Failure on the certificate scheme still applies.

.NET 10 consumers can take 11.x; the MAJOR version tracks the highest .NET major the packages
target, not a breaking change. One dependency floor moves on .NET 10: the packages now depend on
Cause.Core.DataLayerExtensions 11.0.x, which requires a recent Entity Framework Core 10.0.x patch
(10.0.15 or later at the time of writing). A host that references an older EF Core 10.0.x directly
must raise it. Applications on .NET 11 resolve the .NET 11 builds of
Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authentication.JwtBearer and Cause.Core.DataLayerExtensions.

All published packages must be upgraded together. See
docs/adr/records/2026-11-23-multi-target-frameworks-and-central-package-management.md.
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>True</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <Company>CAUCA 9-1-1</Company>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
